This template is the same as [[Template:Xpds]], except that it starts the result of the template, variable or parser function call to be demonstrated in a new paragraph. This is in particular important if the rendering of the resulting wikitext depends on this, such as in the case of a table or list.

The template uses [[Module:Xpd]]; see also [[Module talk:Xpd]].

Example: 

<code><nowiki>{{xpdp|2x|*abc</nowiki><br>}}</code> gives:

{{xpdp|2x|*abc
}}

